あのね 実は 私 好きな人がいるのって
You know... actually, I have someone I like...

332
00:37:32,538 --> 00:37:37,618
ちょっとマジで？
Are you serious?!

333
00:37:37,618 --> 00:37:43,138
三角形 三角形の恋は気まぐれ
A triangle, triangular love is fickle,

334
00:37:43,138 --> 00:37:48,778
一瞬で 一瞬で 崩れるバランス
collapsing in an instant, in an instant's balance!

335
00:37:48,778 --> 00:37:54,618
ベタなマンガ みたいなフラグ まさか自分 が立てちゃうなんて
Like a cliché manga flag—to think I'd set one up myself,

336
00:37:54,618 --> 00:37:59,938
残念すぎます！
how terribly unfortunate!

337
00:37:59,938 --> 00:38:05,318
三角形 三角形の恋は不安定
A triangle, triangular love is unstable,

338
00:38:05,318 --> 00:38:10,798
なんちゃって なんちゃってじゃ済まないカテゴリー
a category that can't be brushed off as "just kidding"!

339
00:38:10,798 --> 00:38:16,458
恋と友情 ゆらゆらめいて なんか青春しちゃいます
Swaying between love and friendship, it feels like youth...

340
00:38:16,458 --> 00:38:20,798
私 困っちゃいます
I'm in quite a bind!

341
00:38:41,778 --> 00:38:47,558
三杯です おに愛しすぎるわがまま こうじゃない
Three cups of overly loving selfishness... not quite like this,

342
00:38:47,558 --> 00:38:52,778
寂しいけど とか そんなんじゃないって本心で言うからに
though I feel lonely, I'm saying it from the bottom of my heart,

343
00:38:52,778 --> 00:38:58,518
応援を もしくは もしや すがすがしい
cheering you on, or perhaps feeling refreshed...

344
00:38:58,518 --> 00:39:03,598
だけど 彼女は 不思議な顔
Yet she has a mysterious look on her face.

345
00:39:03,598 --> 00:39:09,338
真剣な目で そうじゃなくて 私 あなたが好き
With a serious gaze: "That's not it, I like you."

346
00:39:09,338 --> 00:39:14,578
ごめんって おまじで？
"Sorry!" "Are you for real?!"

347
00:39:14,578 --> 00:39:20,198
三角形 三角形の恋は気まぐれ
A triangle, triangular love is fickle,

348
00:39:20,198 --> 00:39:25,758
一瞬で 一瞬で 崩れるバランス
collapsing in an instant, in an instant's balance!

349
00:39:25,758 --> 00:39:31,738
私 あなた 彼女と私 超絶複雑
Me, you, her, and me—super ultra complex,

350
00:39:31,738 --> 00:39:37,278
繰り展開は 想定外です！
the development is completely unexpected!

351
00:39:37,278 --> 00:39:42,758
三角形 三角形の恋は不安定
A triangle, triangular love is unstable,

352
00:39:42,758 --> 00:39:48,198
なんちゃって なんちゃってじゃ済まないカテゴリー
a category that can't be brushed off as "just kidding"!

353
00:39:48,198 --> 00:39:53,978
解けない パズル 与えたもうた 神よ
An unsolvable puzzle bestowed upon us by the gods...

354
00:39:53,978 --> 00:40:00,818
恨んじゃいます！
I could just curse them!

355
00:40:02,057 --> 00:40:05,557
終わらないよ…！
It's not over yet...!

356
00:40:05,557 --> 00:40:08,557
もっともっと…！
More and more...!

357
00:40:09,557 --> 00:40:15,057
Thank you, Ruffians! We love you so much!

358
00:40:18,557 --> 00:40:22,557
まだ生きてる…？生きてるよ！
Are you still alive...? We're alive!

359
00:40:23,057 --> 00:40:27,057
よし、次は…！
Alright, next is...!

360
00:42:13,257 --> 00:42:15,557
Thank you so much, Ruffians!

361
00:42:15,557 --> 00:42:18,057
We love you so much!

362
00:42:18,057 --> 00:42:24,557
You know, I got a bit dizzy though, the bubble and then changing so quickly!

363
00:42:24,557 --> 00:42:31,057
Nice and fast! Yeah! You know, the bubble dance is a little bit silly! But did we surprise you?

364
00:42:31,057 --> 00:42:37,057
And we got this year's smiles even more close up than usual! Yeah!

365
00:42:37,057 --> 00:42:46,057
Well, the last two songs, we sang 'Kiss Me, I Stated' together with Advent, and 'Triangle Dreamear'!

366
00:42:46,057 --> 00:42:53,057
Yeah, with Licky-senpai, Mior-senpai, and Suisei-senpai! What do you think, Ruffians?

367
00:42:53,057 --> 00:43:02,057
And 'Kiss Me, I Stated' is the song that I've always wanted to sing together with Advent! And it's a little bit more sexy song, oh wait, sexy song, huh?

368
00:43:02,057 --> 00:43:11,057
Yeah, and 'Triangle Dreamear', the festival idol song! Yeah, so unity-kan... I got too cute-suge de...

369
00:43:11,057 --> 00:43:15,557
Rafians are still alive? Are you still alive out there? Bau Bau!

370
00:43:15,557 --> 00:43:24,057
Our older senpais were so cute and love! And when crowd sung together, boubou! Yeah, wow! It was a burst!

371
00:43:24,057 --> 00:43:31,057
A lot of bursts this year, right? Yeah! Well, we have a tiny, tiny announcement!

372
00:43:31,057 --> 00:43:38,557
You know, uh, as for Fuwamo, it's our birthday, right? Yeah, our birthday! And so, we have something we'd like to share with you!

373
00:43:38,557 --> 00:43:45,057
Let's do it! Yeah! Don't know! Popon!

374
00:43:45,057 --> 00:43:54,557
It's time to celebrate both of our birthdays with our FUWAMOCO 2026 Birthday Merch!

375
00:43:55,557 --> 00:43:59,057
Pop! It's time to celebrate both of our birthdays with our FUWAMOCO 2026 Birthday Merch!

376
00:44:08,857 --> 00:44:19,057
First, we became fluffy and fuzzy idols with the Fuwa Fuwa Idol☆Fuwawa Acrylic Stand and Moco Moco Idol☆Mococo Acrylic Stand! John-my-arm-mama, Ico-muchi-mama!

