They're rather big compared to regular acrylic stands, so we think they'll be a great addition to your collection! OKM-size is a bit cute, I don't know, Fuwawa-Mococo acrylic stand!

378
00:44:29,557 --> 00:44:44,557
Next, we have the silly Ehehe Angel☆Rubber Figurine and HOEH?! Devil☆Rubber Figurine! We're now palm-sized figures, perfect for displaying on your desk! I don't know, Fuwawamococo got tenohira-size no rubber mascot ni natta yo!

