This one is big! We finally have Fuwawamococo plushies in our out-and-about casual outfits! But this time, we also speak when you hug us! It's the Yappy Puppy☆Fuwawa Sounds Plushie! Will be the same size as the friends' UFO plushies, so you can display them together!

380
00:45:02,794 --> 00:45:11,044
おしゃべりぴゅー☆MOCOCOぬいぐるみのはーむこだよ！ぎゅっとするといろいろしゃべるよ！どんなボイスが出るかお楽しみに！
It's the Talking Fuwa☆Mococo Plushie, Huwamoco! Hug it and it'll talk to you! Look forward to hearing what kind of voice lines come out!

381
00:45:11,584 --> 00:45:21,964
We have the Fuwawa to GO☆Finger Puppet! Ooh! They both come with one extra Ruffian's finger puppet costume you can dress us up in and bring around with you everywhere!

382
00:45:22,334 --> 00:45:29,014
ふわわの指パペットと！どれも一緒に連れていけるサイズで着せ替えラフィアンズ一緒もあるよ！
Fuwawa's finger puppet! They're sized so you can bring them anywhere, and there are even matching dress-up Ruffians outfits!

383
00:45:29,214 --> 00:45:39,404
Finally, we have two different ASMR voice packs: "Back from a Fluffy Date" with Fuwawa, and "Sweet and Fuzzy Needy Puppy" from Mococo!

384
00:45:39,524 --> 00:45:48,984
ASMRボイスは英語と日本語両方で収録してます！耳膜ハイパースポーツ！聴くとき気をつけてね！うー！
The ASMR voice packs are recorded in both English and Japanese! It's eardrum hyper sports! Be careful when you listen to them! Ooh!

385
00:45:49,324 --> 00:45:55,854
The merch is separated into two sets: Fuwawa's Birthday Merch and Mococo's Birthday Merch!

386
00:45:56,114 --> 00:46:02,514
誕生記念フルセットを購入すると、ボーナスが含まれていて、チェキ風ブロマイドカードに特別なボーナスボイス！
If you purchase the Birthday Full Set, it comes with bonuses, including a cheki-style bromide card with a special bonus voice!

387
00:46:02,694 --> 00:46:11,304
グッズはふわわセットとモココセットに分かれています！セットごとにチェキ風カードと特典ボイスが付きます！
The goods are divided into the Fuwawa Set and the Mococo Set! Each set comes with a cheki-style card and bonus voice!

388
00:46:11,584 --> 00:46:19,972
The regular version will have a foil stamped replica signature and message, so it'll be just as cute! 数量限定セットは直筆サイン付きだよ！
The regular version will have a foil stamped replica signature and message, so it'll be just as cute! The limited quantity sets come with hand-signed autographs!

389
00:46:19,972 --> 00:46:27,574
いっぱい愛を込めてサイン書くからね！そう！たくさん愛を込めてサイン書きますね！
We're putting lots of love into writing every single signature, so we hope you look forward to it! We put lots of love into signing every single one, you know!

390
00:46:27,874 --> 00:46:37,884
Please check out the Hololive official online shop and look for the link in the description and comment area, okay? 是非ホロライブ公式ショップにチェックしてください！ぽぷぁ！
Please check out the Hololive official online shop and look for the link in the description and comment area, okay? Be sure to check the Hololive Official Shop! Popua!

391
00:46:39,175 --> 00:46:44,975
What do you think? Yappy! Fuwawa and Mococo's birthday merchandise is pretty cool, huh?

392
00:46:45,175 --> 00:46:51,475
The reservations are going on sale right after the birthday live here ends, so don't forget, okay?

393
00:46:51,575 --> 00:46:59,575
サタンのグッズの予約は、この後開始しますので、お忘れずにチェックしてくださいね！
Reservations for Satan's goods will start right after this, so don't forget to check them out!

394
00:46:59,775 --> 00:47:09,575
Don't forget, okay? We put a lot of love into it, and E.K.OMOCHI-san... Thank you, E.K.OMOCHI-san!

395
00:47:09,875 --> 00:47:13,675
right after this ends, time to go, go, go! Okay! Go bite!

396
00:47:15,472 --> 00:47:24,472
Wow, we've performed a lot of special collaboration songs with dear senpais! But there's still one mystery guest we haven't met yet, right?

397
00:47:24,472 --> 00:47:29,472
まだ会ってない、謎のゲストが1人いるんだよね！やーやー！
There's still one mystery guest we haven't met yet! Yaa yaa!

398
00:47:29,472 --> 00:47:34,972
Well, should we give the Ruffians a hint? Ruffian, you're curious, right?
Well, should we give the Ruffians a hint? Ruffians, you're curious, right?

399
00:47:35,472 --> 00:47:38,972
ほうでび？あ、ヤーゴさん？あ、ヤーゴさん？
Houdebi? Ah, Yagoo-san? Ah, Yagoo-san?

400
00:47:39,272 --> 00:47:44,972
That could be a good guess, maybe? Wow, what a seiso!

401
00:47:45,472 --> 00:47:54,972
Maybe! You should get ready, because you know, they aren't quite as bad as Pero, but they can get pretty nasty sometimes!

402
00:47:55,472 --> 00:47:59,972
Mococo-chan, you're not going to be rude to our next guest or anything, right?

403
00:48:00,472 --> 00:48:02,472
Especially before calling them out!

404
00:48:02,672 --> 00:48:09,972
We'll see! Wow, let's get them out here then! Could it be who could it be? Okay!

405
00:48:10,472 --> 00:48:14,972
せーの！どうぞー！
Ready, set! Here they come!

406
00:48:15,472 --> 00:48:22,972
来たしん！来たしんよ！来たしんよ！ファッキュー！
He's here-shin! He's really here-shin! He's here-shin! Fuck you!

407
00:48:23,472 --> 00:48:27,472
自己紹介お願いします！クロちゃんでーす！わーわーわー！
Please introduce yourself! I'm Kuro-chan! Wa wa wa!

408
00:48:28,472 --> 00:48:30,972
[Title: Japanese Comedian Yasuda Dai Circus Kure-chan]

409
00:48:31,472 --> 00:48:41,972
初めまして！ちわわじゃないよ、ふわだよ！ふわじゃないよ、もこだよ！二人合わせて、ふわもこだよ！こんばんはー！
Nice to meet you! We're not Chihuahuas, we're Fuwa! We're not Fuwa, we're Moco! Together, we're Fuwamoco! Good evening!

410
00:48:42,472 --> 00:48:47,472
よろしくお願いします！よろしくお願いします！
Pleased to meet you! Pleased to meet you!

411
00:48:48,472 --> 00:48:52,972
ふわもこだよ！
Fuwamoco!

412
00:48:53,472 --> 00:48:58,972
ハッピーバースデーだしんよ、ふわもこ！いっしんね！いっしんね！
Happy birthday-shin, Fuwamoco! One heart-shin! One heart-shin!

413
00:49:00,972 --> 00:49:09,972
ちょっとね、えっと、視聴者のラフィアンズはたくさんいると思いますけど、クロちゃんがどんな人なのか説明してもらえますか？
Um, I think there are lots of Ruffians watching, but could you explain what kind of person Kuro-chan is?

414
00:49:10,472 --> 00:49:13,972
自分ですの、それ？自己紹介！わかったしんよ！
You want me to do it myself? My self-introduction! Got it-shin!

415
00:49:14,472 --> 00:49:20,472
だってこれ海外の人も見てますもんね！海外の人も分かる自己紹介しますからね！
Because people overseas are watching this too, right? I'll make an introduction that overseas viewers can understand too!

416
00:49:21,472 --> 00:49:25,972
Nice to meet you, nice to meet you, chu chu chu chu chu... Tulip!

417
00:49:26,472 --> 00:49:35,972
え、困らないで！え、クロちゃんは、え、チューリップ？いやチューリップ、の、の、の、の、ちょっとまだわからないかもしれないから
Eh, don't freeze up! Eh, Kuro-chan, is it... tulips? No, tulips... wait, people might not get it yet, so...

418
00:49:39,472 --> 00:49:48,972
えっとね、安田大サーカスっていうトリオを組んでる、えっと、芸人さんで、あと、豆柴の大群のプロデューサーもやってまして、作詞とかもしてます、クロちゃんです！
Um, I'm in a trio called Yasuda Dai Circus as a comedian, and I'm also the producer for Mameshiba no Taigun, writing lyrics and stuff. I'm Kuro-chan!

419
00:49:49,472 --> 00:49:53,972
じゃあ今回は英語でお願いします！イングリッシュ？僕が？自分で？Yes!
Then this time, in English please! English? Me? By myself? Yes!

420
00:49:57,472 --> 00:50:01,472
え、そんなこと急に言われたら、イッツ・シャイ・パ、フラワ…
Eh, if you tell me that all of a sudden... It's shy pa, flower...

421
00:50:01,967 --> 00:50:03,367
え、言い訳はなし！
Eh, no excuses!

422
00:50:03,467 --> 00:50:04,967
いや、聞いてる人の話！
No, I'm talking about the listeners!

423
00:50:05,067 --> 00:50:06,267
え！？
Eh!?

424
00:50:06,267 --> 00:50:07,067
ね？
Right?

425
00:50:06,267 --> 00:50:07,567
頑張って！ファッション！
Do your best! Fashion!

426
00:50:07,467 --> 00:50:09,367
英語、えっと、なんだろ、なんだろ、えっと…
English... um, what could it be, what could it be, um...

427
00:50:09,867 --> 00:50:11,267
フェイマス・コメディアン！
Famous comedian!

428
00:50:11,567 --> 00:50:12,467
おお！
Oo!

429
00:50:12,467 --> 00:50:15,367
コメディアン！あと、アイドル・プロデューサー！
Comedian! And, idol producer!

430
00:50:15,567 --> 00:50:16,567
やーやーかっこいい！
Yay, yay, so cool!

431
00:50:16,967 --> 00:50:18,367
やってるシーンよ！
He's doing it right now, you know!

432
00:50:18,367 --> 00:50:18,967
うん！
Yeah!

433
00:50:18,967 --> 00:50:20,367
おお、できる！いける！
Oh, you can do it! You've got this!

434
00:50:20,567 --> 00:50:24,067
くろちゃんテレビでよく見てるけど、ちょっとふわもこのペットのペロちゃんと、えっと、ちょっと似てる所があるよね。
I watch Kuro-chan on TV all the time, but he kinda looks a bit like FUWAMOCO's pet, Pero.

435
00:50:24,267 --> 00:50:26,067
あるよね！
He does!

436
00:50:24,367 --> 00:50:28,667
え、ちょっと似てる所がある？あるよね！え、ちょっと後ろの顔に見てくださいね、みんなすかー！
Eh, you think they look a bit similar? There are definitely some similarities! Hey, look at the face in the back, everyone!

437
00:50:35,367 --> 00:50:37,767
そっくりでペロです！ペロ！
It's the spitting image of Pero! Pero!

438
00:50:38,067 --> 00:50:38,967
ちょっと待って！
Wait a minute!

439
00:50:38,967 --> 00:50:41,467
球体ってか、丸いところが似てるだけじゃない？
Isn't it just that it's spherical, like, round in the same places?

440
00:50:41,667 --> 00:50:42,667
それだけじゃない！
That's not all!

441
00:50:42,767 --> 00:50:44,067
本当？
Really?

442
00:50:44,067 --> 00:50:46,667
ええっと、クロちゃんと似てるところは…うん、嘘つきで…女の子好きで…
Um, the parts where he looks like Kuro-chan are... um, a liar... loves girls...

443
00:50:47,267 --> 00:50:49,267
え？嘘好きで？女の子好きで？
Eh? Loves lying? Loves girls?

444
00:50:49,267 --> 00:50:50,967
あら、よろしい！
Oh my, that's fine!

445
00:50:50,967 --> 00:50:51,667
うん！
Yeah!

446
00:50:51,967 --> 00:50:54,067
だからね、見得でだまされないで！え、クロちゃんはそんなんで大丈夫なのって言われて…
So you see, don't be fooled by false appearances! "Kuro-chan, is it really okay for you to be like that?" you might ask...

447
00:50:57,167 --> 00:51:01,667
いや、ひどい！悲しくなってきた！えんえんえんえん！遠目で、はい、ひょーん！
No, that's awful! I'm getting sad! Wah-wah-wah-wah! From a distance, yep, hyon!

448
00:51:02,067 --> 00:51:04,367
えんぽうすえふん！
Enpousuefun!

449
00:51:05,067 --> 00:51:07,967
全然人のギャグを効かないよね、君たちは！
You guys completely ignore other people's gags!

450
00:51:09,067 --> 00:51:14,367
できるば…クロちゃんはペロの友達になってくれませんか？
If possible... Kuro-chan, won't you become Pero's friend?

451
00:51:15,067 --> 00:51:18,067
え？ふわもこの友達じゃなくてペロの友達なの？
Huh? Not FUWAMOCO's friend, but Pero's friend?

452
00:51:18,067 --> 00:51:21,867
いや、ふわもこはクロちゃんと友達になりたくないから！
Well, FUWAMOCO doesn't want to become friends with Kuro-chan!

453
00:51:22,067 --> 00:51:22,967
おかしくないそれ？
Isn't that weird?

454
00:51:23,067 --> 00:51:25,167
いや、いや、いや！気持ち悪いから！
No, no, no! Because it's creepy!

455
00:51:25,167 --> 00:51:28,267
いや、気持ち悪くない！マニアには受ける！
No, it's not creepy! It appeals to maniacs!

456
00:51:28,267 --> 00:51:28,867
いや、違う！
No way!

457
00:51:28,867 --> 00:51:31,067
ふわも気持ち悪いよ、やっぱり！
FUWAMOCO is creepy after all!

458
00:51:31,067 --> 00:51:35,367
うん！でも、でも、もこちゃん！ちょっとやりすぎですよ！失礼です！
Yeah! But, but Mococo-chan! That's going too far! That's rude!

459
00:51:36,067 --> 00:51:42,667
いや、もし、もしもペロと仲良くなってほしいんだったら、ふわもこちゃん、クロちゃんに可愛らしく頼んだほうがいいんじゃない？
No, if, if you want us to get along with Pero, shouldn't FUWAMOCO ask Kuro-chan nicely?

460
00:51:43,067 --> 00:51:45,667
はあ？え？なに？
Huh? Eh? What?

461
00:51:46,067 --> 00:51:48,367
しっかりとしなさいって！
Get a hold of yourselves!

462
00:51:49,067 --> 00:51:53,067
え、ま、けどペロ可愛いから仲良くなってもいいとは思ってるよ！
Well, but Pero is cute, so I think it'd be fine if we became friends!

463
00:51:53,367 --> 00:51:59,667
あ、嬉しい！嬉しいよね！可愛くないけど、仲良くなってくれたら嬉しいかな！
Oh, yay! I'm so glad, right? Not that you're cute, but I'd be happy if you became friends!

464
00:52:00,067 --> 00:52:02,367
感情が、感情が色々ありすぎなのよ、本当に！
You guys have way too many emotions going on, really!

465
00:52:03,067 --> 00:52:09,367
まあ、まあ！クロちゃんって芸人さんだけど、アイドルになりたいんですよね？
Well, well! Kuro-chan is a comedian, but you want to be an idol, right?

